# The native core .so + generated Kotlin bindings are produced by
# ui/desktop/core/build-android-jni.sh into ui/desktop/target/ (already gitignored)
# and consumed in place by the :inboxcore module — nothing to track here.

# The email-body WebView bundle is generated from the shared @inbox2/email-body
# package by `bin/android bundle` (esbuild), like iOS's Resources/email-body.js —
# a build artifact, not a hand-maintained copy.
/app/src/main/assets/email-body.js

